flowchart LR
    Scope[Release scope and gates] --> Collect[Collect dated evidence]
    Collect --> Validate[Validate coverage and freshness]
    Validate --> Assess[Assess risks and gate results]
    Assess --> Decision{Controller decision}
    Decision -->|GO| Approve[Ready to proceed]
    Decision -->|CONDITIONAL_GO| Actions[Track conditions and owners]
    Decision -->|NO_GO| Block[Resolve blocking findings]
    Decision -->|NOT_ASSESSABLE| Missing[Collect missing evidence]